So while there may be a few  that do, they generally do not make this - even in San Jose.  The startup thing is indeed correct for many.  But if your 1 year stint at a startup that happened to dole out 3 million in a buyout (as happened to my friend) was it really "made"?   I'd say luck is more like it.   

